WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.000
-Thank you for being
my first guest in the year 2022.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.601
Thank you. I'm honored.
I'm honored.

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:06.367
-Thank you. Thank you.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:07.834
It's going to be a good year.
-You know it.

00:00:07.834 --> 00:00:09.300
It's going to be -- Yeah.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.267
Do you typically make
any New Year's resolution?

00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:13.868
-To be a better person
than what I was last year.

00:00:13.868 --> 00:00:15.601
-How is that possible with you?

00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:17.767
-It's possible.
I fall short sometimes.

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:20.367
Yeah, I fall short.
-Do you really?

00:00:20.367 --> 00:00:22.200
-It's like "Oh, I'm going to eat
healthier. I'm going to do this.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.601
I'm going to lose weight."
No, I never stuck to that stuff.

00:00:24.601 --> 00:00:25.834
-No.
-No.

00:00:25.834 --> 00:00:29.167
I figure if I just say
I'll be a better person,

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:31.767
a better father, better friend,
better son, better whatever,

00:00:31.767 --> 00:00:33.400
I can stick to that.
-I like that.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:34.367
That's awesome.
-Yeah.

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:36.267
-I do.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:38.133
Happy to come back.
I love when you're here.

00:00:38.133 --> 00:00:40.100
Obviously, the audience,
we love you too,

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.801
but I want to talk to you
about this,

00:00:41.801 --> 00:00:43.367
because you went to Dubai
recently.

00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:45.667
-I did.
-Now, how did you end up there,

00:00:45.667 --> 00:00:47.667
and what's going on in Dubai?

00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:49.701
-Steve Harvey is
a very good friend of mine.

00:00:49.701 --> 00:00:50.901
-Love Steve.

00:00:50.901 --> 00:00:53.934
-And he had his celebrity
golf tournament there,

00:00:53.934 --> 00:00:55.467
you know,
for his various charities.

00:00:55.467 --> 00:00:58.534
And so he invited us over,
so we all went over there, man.

00:00:58.534 --> 00:01:00.167
And it was a great time.

00:01:00.167 --> 00:01:03.567
It was me, Yvonne Orji
from "Insecure."

00:01:03.567 --> 00:01:05.934
Ahmad Rashad.
-Yes.

00:01:05.934 --> 00:01:08.167
-Akon.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.167 --> 00:01:09.400
Yeah, right?
-Akon plays golf?

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:11.934
-Akon, yeah. Well, well!

00:01:11.934 --> 00:01:13.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.534
I'm not going to say that.

00:01:15.534 --> 00:01:17.467
And I got an issue with this.

00:01:17.467 --> 00:01:21.334
Akon has never played golf
before in his life, right?

00:01:21.334 --> 00:01:22.434
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.434 --> 00:01:24.133
Never played golf before
in his life.

00:01:24.133 --> 00:01:26.000
-Yeah.
-But won the tournament.

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.267
-That's my man.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:27.267 --> 00:01:29.367
-No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.
-That's my man.

00:01:29.367 --> 00:01:30.968
-No, no, no.

00:01:30.968 --> 00:01:34.167
Alright, so, he came --
his team came in first.

00:01:34.167 --> 00:01:37.634
Steve Harvey's team
came in second.

00:01:38.667 --> 00:01:40.601
My team didn't even place
at all.

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:42.367
[ Laughter ]
But this is it.

00:01:42.367 --> 00:01:44.501
Akon was playing ahead of me.

00:01:44.501 --> 00:01:47.400
And Steve and his team
were playing behind me.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:50.501
So I got to see how horrible
both these teams were.

00:01:50.501 --> 00:01:51.834
-Yeah.
-And they both --

00:01:51.834 --> 00:01:54.300
One took first place, one took
second -- third place.

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.200
And I didn't place at all.
-It's rigged.

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:58.000
-Yeah, very much so.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.501
I'm not going to say it was
rigged, but it was rigged.

00:02:00.501 --> 00:02:02.968
[ Laughter ]
-What is Dubai like?

00:02:02.968 --> 00:02:04.434
I've seen pictures.
What is Dubai?

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:07.367
-Dubai is unlike any other city
that I've been in, man.

00:02:07.367 --> 00:02:10.767
They say it's the city
of the future.

00:02:10.767 --> 00:02:13.000
When I was there a few weeks
ago, it was --

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:16.100
they're having the World Expo
there, which is the first time

00:02:16.100 --> 00:02:18.567
it's been held in a Muslim
country, which was beautiful.

00:02:18.567 --> 00:02:20.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.167
It's still going on.

00:02:22.167 --> 00:02:23.601
And it was also World Day.

00:02:23.601 --> 00:02:24.601
It was their birthday.

00:02:24.601 --> 00:02:27.033
Dubai's only 50. I'm 51.

00:02:27.033 --> 00:02:28.267
I'm older than Dubai.

00:02:28.267 --> 00:02:29.901
-Wow! That's interesting.

00:02:29.901 --> 00:02:31.434
-I'm older than Dubai.

00:02:31.434 --> 00:02:32.901
-But you're back in New York
for a little bit?

00:02:32.901 --> 00:02:34.934
-I'm back in New York
for a little bit. A lot of bit.

00:02:34.934 --> 00:02:36.667
-I'm excited about this.
-So am I, man.

00:02:36.667 --> 00:02:37.968
-You're doing "Law &amp; Order"
again.

00:02:37.968 --> 00:02:40.367
-Back to "Law &amp; Order."
Detective Kevin Bernard.

00:02:40.367 --> 00:02:41.767
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Come on, bud!

00:02:41.767 --> 00:02:43.200
-Yeah.
-Dude, this is big.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.934
-Yeah, yeah.
-How does it feel to come back?

00:02:45.934 --> 00:02:47.534
-It feels great, man.

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:51.601
I'm back in a well-worn saddle
that just grips your ass.

00:02:51.601 --> 00:02:54.100
-There you go. That's exactly
the way to put it. Yeah.

00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.234
-Yeah.

00:02:55.234 --> 00:02:57.400
-It's fun to have you
back on NBC.

00:02:57.400 --> 00:02:58.534
This is going to be fun, bud.
-Yeah, good to be back.

00:02:58.534 --> 00:02:59.701
-And New York.
-Yeah.

00:02:59.701 --> 00:03:00.834
-We got to hang out,
figure out something.

00:03:00.834 --> 00:03:02.634
How's Mom doing,
first and foremost,

00:03:02.634 --> 00:03:04.067
'cause you know
I love your mother.

00:03:04.067 --> 00:03:05.934
-Mom is doing great.
-Doris.

00:03:05.934 --> 00:03:07.634
-Yeah, Mama Doris
is doing great.

00:03:07.634 --> 00:03:10.234
She's single now, thanks to our
last appearance on your show.

00:03:10.234 --> 00:03:11.501
-No.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:11.501 --> 00:03:13.033
-Yeah.
-No, because of that?

00:03:13.033 --> 00:03:15.467
-Those who remember,
it don't work!

00:03:15.467 --> 00:03:17.400
-No, he didn't like it?
-He didn't.

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:19.000
He never called my mama
after that night.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.934
[ Laughter ]

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:22.434
Hey, man, why you laughing?!

00:03:22.434 --> 00:03:24.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:24.834 --> 00:03:27.234
He never called --
My mom was so excited.

00:03:27.234 --> 00:03:29.100
She was like, "Baby, baby.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:32.033
Look, me and Anthony had fun
with your -- at your expense

00:03:32.033 --> 00:03:34.868
on 'Fallon' tonight,
but watch the show."

00:03:34.868 --> 00:03:37.133
To this day he hasn't called
my mama back, Fallon.

00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:39.133
-Ah!
-So this what you got to do.

00:03:39.133 --> 00:03:40.400
When I bring my mama
to New York,

00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:42.067
we got to set my mama up
on a new date.

00:03:42.067 --> 00:03:44.868
-Oh, of course. Doris, easy.
-Alright.

00:03:44.868 --> 00:03:46.901
You hear that, Mama?
-Easy-peasy.

00:03:46.901 --> 00:03:49.934
And, Doris, we don't need him
anyway 'cause it didn't work.

00:03:49.934 --> 00:03:52.367
-Stop, man! Stop!
[ Laughter ]

00:03:52.367 --> 00:03:53.734
But it don't work!

00:03:53.734 --> 00:03:57.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:57.100 --> 00:03:59.434
-I heard your mom is doing --

00:03:59.434 --> 00:04:01.968
I heard your mom is doing
something with Eddie Murphy.

00:04:01.968 --> 00:04:03.334
-She is, man.

00:04:03.334 --> 00:04:05.667
We both are, but my mom is
in Eddie Murphy's new movie

00:04:05.667 --> 00:04:07.601
with Jonah Hill
and a bunch of other people.

00:04:07.601 --> 00:04:09.534
[ Cheers and applause ]
Yeah.

00:04:09.534 --> 00:04:12.400
You know, everybody always,
"Does your mom get star-struck?"

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:15.133
I was like, "Yeah and no.
She plays it cool."

00:04:15.133 --> 00:04:17.534
She was in a scene with Eddie
and one of the A.D.s says,

00:04:17.534 --> 00:04:19.901
"Ah! I think we have to
do it again."

00:04:19.901 --> 00:04:22.400
And out of nowhere, my mama
said, "[Bleep] I hope we don't."

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.934
[ Laughter ]

00:04:23.934 --> 00:04:25.200
And Eddie Murphy turned to him

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:26.934
and was like, "Was that
Anthony Anderson's mama?"

00:04:26.934 --> 00:04:28.968
He was like, "Yeah."
He said, "Man, she is funny!"

00:04:28.968 --> 00:04:31.100
[ Laughter ]
-I love it.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:35.000
Hey, Mom, we're setting you up
when you come back to New York.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.100
-Hopefully with somebody
who works.

00:04:37.100 --> 00:04:39.267
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:04:39.267 --> 00:04:41.534
When we come back, I want to
talk about the final season

00:04:41.534 --> 00:04:42.834
of "Black-ish" and also about

00:04:42.834 --> 00:04:44.767
having Michelle Obama
on your show.

00:04:44.767 --> 00:04:46.467
More with Anthony Anderson
when we come back.

00:04:46.467 --> 00:04:47.634
Come on back, everybody.

